pattern   subject                                        /i   /iu
k         U+004B LATIN CAPITAL LETTER K                  yes  yes
k         U+212A KELVIN SIGN                             no   yes
s         U+017F LATIN SMALL LETTER LONG S               no   yes
U+00DF    U+1E9E LATIN CAPITAL LETTER SHARP S            no   yes
U+1E9E    U+00DF LATIN SMALL LETTER SHARP S              no   yes
ss        U+00DF LATIN SMALL LETTER SHARP S              no   no
[k]       U+212A KELVIN SIGN                             no   yes
